### Verificar Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Ver Perfil
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ============================================
### MÉDICOS (ROTAS PÚBLICAS)
### ============================================

### Listar Médicos Ativos (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/doctors/active

### Listar Especialidades (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/doctors/specialties

### Buscar Médicos por Especialidade (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/doctors/specialty/Cardiologia


### ============================================
### PACIENTES (ADMIN)
### ============================================

### Listar Pacientes
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Buscar Paciente por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/PATIENT_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Criar Paciente
POST {{baseUrl}}/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "novo@email.com",
  "password": "senha123",
  "name": "Novo Paciente",
  "cpf": "12312312312",
  "phone": "11999999999",
  "birthDate": "2000-01-01",
  "address": "Rua Teste, 123"
}


### ============================================
### CONSULTAS
### ============================================

### Listar Consultas (ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Listar Minhas Consultas (PATIENT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/appointments/my
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Listar Minhas Consultas (DOCTOR)
GET {{baseUrl}}/appointments/my
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### Criar Consulta (PATIENT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "PATIENT_ID_AQUI",
  "doctorId": "DOCTOR_ID_AQUI",
  "appointmentDate": "2026-07-01",
  "appointmentTime": "10:00",
  "notes": "Consulta de teste"
}


### ============================================
### INDISPONIBILIDADES
### ============================================

### Ver Indisponibilidades Futuras de um Médico (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/doctor-unavailability/doctor/DOCTOR_ID_AQUI/future

### Criar Indisponibilidade (DOCTOR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/doctor-unavailability
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctorId": "DOCTOR_ID_AQUI",
  "unavailableDate": "2026-08-01",
  "startTime": "14:00",
  "endTime": "18:00",
  "reason": "Conferência"
}
